--  Configuration pragmas for proving tasking code.
--
--  SPARK only analyses tasks and protected objects when the tasking profile and
--  the elaboration policy are pinned down (SPARK RM 9(2)), because both affect
--  what concurrency is possible. Without these, GNATprove reports:
--
--    error: tasking in SPARK requires sequential elaboration (SPARK RM 9(2))
--
--  These match what the board actually runs: the embedded-nrf52833 runtime is a
--  Ravenscar-profile runtime.
pragma Profile (Ravenscar);
pragma Partition_Elaboration_Policy (Sequential);
